---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Team — AI Playbook" description="Meet the team behind AI Playbook — journalists, engineers, and designers testing AI tools so you don't have to.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2">Our Team</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10">The people behind every review, tutorial, and comparison on AI Playbook.</p>

    <!-- Sarah Chen -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
        SC
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Sarah Chen</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3">Editor-in-Chief</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Sarah oversees all editorial content at AI Playbook. With 8 years of experience in tech journalism
          (previously at The Verge and TechCrunch), she specializes in AI tools for productivity, design,
          and content creation. She's tested over 200 AI tools for this site alone and personally reviews
          every article before it goes live.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          <span class="font-medium">Expertise:</span> AI productivity tools, design tools, content creation,
          editorial workflows.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">
          <strong>Selected articles:</strong> Cursor Review, Gamma AI Review, ChatGPT Pro review,
          Best AI Productivity Tools 2026.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Marcus Webb -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
        MW
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Marcus Webb</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3">Reviews Editor, Developer Tools</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Marcus is a former software engineer who spent 6 years building full-stack applications before
          switching to tech journalism. He leads our developer tools coverage, coding AI reviews, and
          all comparisons involving programming assistants. Marcus has personally tested Cursor, Copilot,
          Claude Code, Windsurf, and 30+ other AI coding tools against real codebases.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          <span class="font-medium">Expertise:</span> AI coding assistants, IDEs, developer tools,
          CI/CD automation, API platforms.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">
          <strong>Selected articles:</strong> Claude 4 Opus Coding Review, AI Coding Agents Comparison,
          V0 by Vercel Review, Windsurf IDE Review.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Elena Torres -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 mb-10 pb-10 border-b border-gray-200">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-pink-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
        ET
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Elena Torres</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3">Tutorials Editor</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Elena is a content strategist and former product manager who specializes in making complex
          AI workflows accessible. She structures every tutorial to be followable by beginners while
          still valuable for advanced users. Before AI Playbook, she ran a 50K-subscriber YouTube channel
          teaching automation tools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          <span class="font-medium">Expertise:</span> AI automation, no-code tools, workflow design,
          content strategy, video production.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">
          <strong>Selected articles:</strong> Deploy AI Agent Pipeline to Vercel, Build RAG with LangChain,
          AI YouTube Automation, AI Email Campaign Tutorial.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- James Park -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-cyan-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold">
        JP
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">James Park</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-blue-600 font-medium mb-3">Technical Editor &amp; Fact-Checker</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          James holds a Master's in Computer Science and worked as an ML engineer at a Fortune 500
          company for 5 years before joining AI Playbook. He handles our most technical content —
          model comparisons, benchmark analyses, and deep dives into AI architecture. He also runs
          our fact-checking process, verifying every technical claim before publication.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          <span class="font-medium">Expertise:</span> LLM benchmarks, model architecture, AI infrastructure,
          data science tools, technical fact-checking.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-2">
          <strong>Selected articles:</strong> DeepSeek V4 Review, GPT-5 vs Claude Sonnet 4, Local LLM Guide,
          OpenRouter vs Together AI.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Review Process</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
        Every article on AI Playbook is written by one of our team members and reviewed by at least
        one other editor before publication. Our reviews are based on real, hands-on testing —
        not spec sheets or press releases. Read our full <a href="/methodology" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">review methodology →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
